impl Copy for GuiFontRegisteredFaceSimpleGlyphIndexedStrokeSourceContourCommand:
    fn copy_mark %fn GuiFontRegisteredFaceSimpleGlyphIndexedStrokeSourceContourCommand GuiFontRegisteredFaceSimpleGlyphIndexedStrokeSourceContourCommand \command: command

